ICE version 2.61.1
-------------------------

Release date: 11/12/2026

Release notes are available at https://cdsframework.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ICE/pages/78479371/Release+Notes

Notes:

Supplemental text is enabled by default. See
[Output Configuration](docs/configuration/output-configuration.md)
for the available settings.

ICE returns earliest and overdue dates in addition to the recommended date
by default. To change this behavior, configure
`ice.output-earliest-and-overdue-dates`. See
[Earliest, due, and overdue dates](docs/configuration/output-configuration.md#earliest-due-and-overdue-dates)
for details.
